=== Adjective ===
'''fagur'''
# [[beautiful]]
# (''weather'') very good
# (''literature'') about [[fiction]]

===Synonyms===
'''beautiful'''
*[[fríður]], [[vakur]]

=== Antonyms ===
*[[ljótur]] (ugly)

=== Usage notes ===
*'''fagrir''' [[litur|litir]] - beautiful colors
